  "solution": "Logic : (1st number × 3) + 3 = 2nd number\n\nSo, \n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 2 : 9\n\n**2 × 3**__ + 3 = 9\n\n__**6 + 3**__ = 9\n\n9 = 9 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 6 : 21​\n\n**6 × 3**__ + 3 = 21\n\n__**18 + 3**__ = 21\n\n21 = 21 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 10 : 33 \n\n**10 × 3**__ + 3 = 33\n\n__**30 + 3**__ = 33\n\n33 = 33 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 8 : 29\n\n**8 × 3**__ + 3 = 29\n\n__**24 + 3**__ = 29\n\n**27** ≠ **29** (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
